{"id":"12c265144b53d407","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-barzdins.md","title":"Barzdins Bounds for c.e. Sets","display":"thm-barzdins — Barzdins Bounds for c.e. Sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-barzdins","aliases":["43-thm-barzdins"],"display":"thm-barzdins — Barzdins Bounds for c.e. Sets","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 19.1.1","source_printed_pages":"569","source_pdf_pages":"589","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-barzdins"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-barzdins</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-barzdins — Barzdins Bounds for c.e. Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 19.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"569"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"589"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span> 与自然数编码见直接依赖。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(C(A\\upharpoonright n\\mid n)\\le\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil+c\\land C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le2\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil+c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(C(A\\upharpoonright n\\mid n)\\le\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil+c\\land C(A\\upharpoonright n)\\le2\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil+c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，再给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 在前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 位的元素数，枚举直到这些元素出现即可恢复初始段。无条件情形把长度和计数用等长二进制块编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 边界闭合。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 19.1.1；印刷页 569，PDF 页 589。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-pair-coding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-condplainkolm]